@startuml "Flow Chart, Travel Authorization Wizard UI Flow, 2026-06-12"

title "Travel Authorization Wizard — Full UI Flow (All 16 Steps)"

skinparam swimlaneWidth same
skinparam activityBorderColor #555555
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #CCAA00
skinparam arrowColor #444444

|Traveller|
|Supervisor / Admin|
|Finance User|

|Traveller|
start

:**[1] Trip Purpose** (edit-trip-purpose)
Fill in purpose, destination, department
→ Continue;

:**[2] Trip Details** (edit-trip-details)
Enter travel segments (From/To/Date/Method/Hotel)
**Dates must be in the past**
→ Continue;

:**[3] Trip Estimates** (edit-trip-estimates)
Add/review estimates (Accommodations, Transport, M&I)
→ Continue;

:**[4] Submit Travel Request** (submit-travel-request)
Enter travel advance + supervisor email
→ Submit to Supervisor (status: submitted);

|Supervisor / Admin|

:**[5] Supervisor Approval**
Navigate to /manage-travel-requests/:id/details
Click Approve in Management card
(Vuetify dialog — safe for extension)
→ status: approved;

|Traveller|

:Check status?
→ toast: "Travel authorization approved!";

:**[6] Traveller Details** (edit-traveller-details)
Verify/fill legal name, DOB, address, emergency contact
→ Continue;

:**[7] Submit to Travel Desk** (submit-to-travel-desk)
Review travel desk request form
→ Submit to Travel Desk (status: booked);

|Supervisor / Admin|

:**[8–9] Flight Options**
Navigate to /travel-desk
Add flight options for the TA;

|Traveller|

:**[9] Rank Travel Solutions** (rank-travel-solutions)
Rank flight options;

|Supervisor / Admin|

:**[10] Confirm Booking** (awaiting-travel-desk-booking)
Confirm booking;

|Traveller|

:**[11] Confirm Travel Details** (confirm-travel-details)
Update actual departure details
→ Continue;

:**[12] Submit Expenses** (submit-expenses)
Prefill from Estimates
Upload receipts for all non-M&I expenses
//Receipts required — POST /api/expenses/:id/receipt//
//AI workaround: DataTransfer injection into .d-none inputs//
Add at least one G/L Coding row
//e.g. 552-503010-0222-0006-09999//
→ Submit to Supervisor (status: expense_claim_submitted);

|Supervisor / Admin|

:**[13] Approve Expense Claim** (awaiting-expense-claim-approval)
Navigate to /manage-travel-requests/:id/expense
Click Approve in Management card
//Approve uses blockedToTrueConfirm() — use JS API instead://
//POST /api/travel-authorizations/:id/approve-expense-claim//
→ status: expense_claim_approved;

|Traveller|

:Check status?
→ toast: "Expense claim approved by supervisor!";

|Finance User|

:**[14] Finance Review** (awaiting-finance-review-and-processing)
Navigate to Expense Processing → /expense-processing/:id/expense
Page sections: Traveler Expenses (Edit/View Receipt/Delete)
Meals & Incidentals (Add Receipt) · Expense Totals · Coding · Management
Review and edit expenses and coding rows;

if (Finance action?) then (Approve)
  :POST /api/travel-authorizations/:id/expense
  //Approve uses blockedToTrueConfirm() — use JS API//
  → status: expensed;
elseif () then (Send Back\nto Traveler)
  :Send Back to Traveler dialog (Vuetify — safe)
  → status: expense_claim_traveller_changes_requested;
  detach
elseif () then (Send Back\nto Supervisor)
  :Send Back to Supervisor dialog (Vuetify — safe)
  → status: expense_claim_supervisor_changes_requested;
  detach
else (Deny)
  :Deny dialog (blockedToTrueConfirm — use JS API)
  → status: expense_claim_denied;
  detach
endif

|Traveller|

:**[15] Review Expenses** (review-expenses)
Check status?
→ toast: "Finance has processed your expense claim!"
View approved expense summary with View Receipt links;

stop

@enduml
